{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Unknown Number", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Phrasal Verbs about Phone Communication", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. Some phrasal verbs are unique to communication on the phone.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " Here are more phrasal verbs that are often used for communication over the phone or videochats. Try to use some of these the next time you're chatting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak louder into the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to hang up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to end a conversation and disconnect.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to cut off\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to interrupt a phone conversation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call someone again or in return\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to break up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" when the other person's voice is unclear and you can't hear them well\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Can you please speak up a little? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Just hang up and call me back when you can.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You're breaking up ... I can hardly hear you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sorry, we got cut off there ... what were you saying?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Changing Topics on the Phone", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use expressions to redirect a phone conversation when you wish to get off the current topic or to focus on a different topic.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "To state a reason to get off the topic, you can use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I can't look up my calendar right now. Let me get back to you on that.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To direct the other person's attention to another topic, you can use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">By the way, we forwarded our list of kitchen equipment two weeks ago, but we haven't heard back.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To return the other person to a previous topic to maintain focus:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Anyway, about the appointment, how about Thursday the 12th?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To take attention off of yourself by claiming lack of knowledge:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm afraid I personally don't know about that document. Let me find out.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "unlisted", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not listed in the telephone directory", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It says unknown number on your phone because it's an unlisted number. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use in communication at work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to put me through", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to connect a caller to someone else in the office", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Hi. Can you please put me through to the manager?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "appointment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a set meeting time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We need to make an appointment with you to come in and do a review.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hold on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask the caller to wait a moment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Could you hold on? I need to look at my calendar.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get back to you", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to send a reply later with more information", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let me find out about the document and get back to you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hear back ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to receive a reply by phone or e-mail", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We forwarded our list of kitchen equipment two weeks ago, but we haven't heard back.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "let me know", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask the other person to give you a reply when they find out the information", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Okay, once you find out, please let me know soon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of a problem you might have had <br>with your cell phone company or Internet provider.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a phone dialogue or a text chat complaining about this problem. <br>Use all the phrasal verbs that you have learned from this lesson.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the responses that you would expect from the company representative. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 8 - 10 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue aloud with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I make complaints about a problem. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I manage a phone conversation using the proper action words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I reply to complaints. ", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can manage a phone conversation.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can change topics.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever received a phone call from an unknown number?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Who was it?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What did you say to try to get off the phone quickly?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "at