prelo-dialogue-110\">Vanessa</span>: Hello? Hello? He-e-llOoo?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Assistant Manager</span>: Who was that?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't know. There was nobody there. The phone says \u201cUnknown number\u201d.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Assistant Manager</span>: Oh, an unlisted number.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello, Bistro 88, Vanessa speaking. How can I help you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Caller</span>: Yeah, can you put me through to the manager?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, this is the manager. Who's speaking?", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-110\">Caller</span>:  This is the Health Department. We need to make an appointment with you to come in and do a review of your menu.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: OK, could you hold on?  I can't look up my calendar right now. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Caller</span>: Sure.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: By the way, we forwarded our list of kitchen equipment two weeks ago, but we haven't heard back.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Caller</span>: Yes, the records here show that you did, but I'm afraid I personally don't know about that document. Let me find out, and I'll get back to you.<br/>", "time": "33000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-110\">Vanessa</span>: Okay, please let me know soon. Anyway, about the appointment, how about Thursday the 12th at 9:00 a.m.?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Caller</span>: Yeah, that's fine with us. We'll see you then.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Great. Thanks for calling. Bye.", "time": "59500", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}